<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Sinclair Broadcast cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Sinclair Broadcast cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it cut Sinclair Broadcast Group Inc to a buy from its prior rating of strong buy on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 5-3/4 to 38 in early trading.  </p>
<p>-- Sinclair said late Friday after the market close that it estimates third quarter pro forma broadcast cash flow to be four to five percent below the previous third quarter and revenues to be flat.</p>
</text>
